Z||000000||Slammed Fiero||06-05-2001||01:19 PM|||| <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=1607505&a=12258787&p=49868140&Sequence=0&res=high"> <P>Note the 7000rpm tach  V8 crest from a lotus esprit turbo, I made them myself , printed on a plastic sheet with a laser printer. I just got my hands on some 3M Durel 3 electroluminescent sheet , 3 square feet CHEAP...pays to have friends. When it's all done it will be indiglow.<P>All this in preperation for my N* conversion. So I will have a v8 7000rpm tach with a 2.8 (haha)<P><P>------------------<BR>     <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=1607505&a=12259132&p=48230089&Sequence=0&res=high">     <BR>Jonathan McCreery<BR>86 GT 4spd<BR>Koni's , Coilovers, Big Bars , 17" Trmotorsports Typhoons , 11.25" vented discs, Wilwood 4 Piston Calipers , Pirelli P Zero's, Short Shift, No cat , Cold air induction , Geni Stainless tips, White face gauges , Momo shift , momo pedals..Autocrossed , Tracked , abused.||||reg||1
